# ResumeEvolver canonical core verifier.
# Keep this small: install, local quality checks, and production build.
# Run from the repository root; see README.md#verification-prerequisites-and-safe-lanes
# for required nonempty Supabase build fields and nonsecret compile-only values.

pnpm install
pnpm check
pnpm build

# Database/RLS gate for schema, migration, policy, or derived-output work.
# Run manually when the task touches database behavior, using a disposable local
# Supabase stack only: db:reset deletes local data.
# pnpm db:reset
# pnpm db:test

# Browser smoke gate for protected route or user-flow changes.
# Run manually when the task touches browser flows:
# pnpm test:e2e
